# What `COPY . .` must not carry into the build.
#
# Two of these matter beyond image size. `vendor` is installed inside the build, for this image's
# PHP: the host's copy would be whatever the developer happens to have. `.env.local` and the keys in
# config/jwt are this machine's; a file copied into a layer stays readable to anyone who has the
# image, and the keys that sign a café's tokens are the last thing to hand out.

vendor
var
.env.local
.env.*.local
config/jwt

# Test and tool output.
.phpunit.cache
tests
phpunit.dist.xml

# Version control.
.git
.gitignore

# Editor and operating system files.
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
